* and run  do spinedx_test.do
* Without installing: put spinedx.ado and spinedx_codes.csv in the current folder,
* then  adopath + "."  and  do spinedx_test.do
* Expected values come from an independent Python implementation of the same
* matching rule. Any failure lists the offending rows.
